		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://drownedmadonna.com/?p=5071#comment-23233</guid>
		<description><![CDATA[Ciao Italia was actually called &quot;Who&#039;s That Girl&quot; world tour. Ciao Italia was just the particular name she choice to label the VHS release of the last show in Italy. Personally this is my least favorite of all her tours. I didn&#039;t like the costume arrangements on this tour, however I do love the opening number performance of OPEN YOUR HEART!]]></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Ciao Italia was actually called &quot;Who&#039;s That Girl&quot; world tour. Ciao Italia was just the particular name she choice to label the VHS release of the last show in Italy. Personally this is my least favorite of all her tours. I didn&#039;t like the costume arrangements on this tour, however I do love the opening number performance of OPEN YOUR HEART!</p>
]]></content:encoded>
	</item>
